{#- Debian's unattended-upgrades, already installed and enabled by the
   trixie cloud image (verified on all minions 2026-10-26) — this formula
   pins that state down and makes it visible in Prometheus.

   Origins stay as shipped in 50unattended-upgrades: Debian main (point
   releases) + Debian-Security. The third-party repos (Docker, Salt's
   Artifactory, Wazuh) are therefore never upgraded unattended — docker-ce/
   containerd, salt-minion and wazuh-agent only move when bumped on purpose
   (the agent has to match the manager's version). No Package-Blacklist
   needed for them.

   dropin: settings go into an extra apt.conf.d file sorted after
   50unattended-upgrades/20auto-upgrades; for scalar options the later file
   wins, list options (package_blacklist) are appended. The shipped files
   stay untouched.

   automatic_reboot: off — formulas/orch reboots pending minions nightly,
   one at a time inside the 03:00–06:00 window, master last (RebootRequired
   alert in pillar/prometheus.sls if that doesn't happen). A reboot cuts
   Jellyfin streams, the arrstack VPN stack, the master and the Wazuh
   indexer. If turned on per minion, automatic_reboot_time is when u-u
   reboots after an upgrade that needs it — uncoordinated with the rest.

   apt_timers: apt-daily (package lists, twice a day) and apt-daily-upgrade
   (the u-u run, ~06:00 + up to 60 min random delay) — Debian's own timers.

   metrics: an hourly oneshot (plus once shortly after boot, so
   RebootRequired clears right after a reboot) writes os_* textfile metrics
   into node-exporter's textfile directory (see formulas/salt-minion
   map.jinja) — hence the require on node-exporter. Pending upgrades come
   from `apt-get -s dist-upgrade` against the current lists, without the apt
   lock — only as fresh as the lists, hence the separate list-update
   timestamp (update_stamp_file, written by apt-daily). #}
{%- set defaults = {
    'pkg': 'unattended-upgrades',
    'dropin': '/etc/apt/apt.conf.d/52unattended-upgrades-salt',
    'automatic_reboot': False,
    'automatic_reboot_time': '04:00',
    'remove_unused_kernel_packages': True,
    'remove_unused_dependencies': False,
    'package_blacklist': [],
    'apt_timers': ['apt-daily.timer', 'apt-daily-upgrade.timer'],
    'metrics': {
        'unit': 'os-patch-metrics',
        'script': '/usr/local/sbin/os-patch-metrics',
        'on_calendar': 'hourly',
        'on_boot': '2min',
        'randomized_delay': '5min',
        'python': '/usr/bin/python3',
        'apt_get': '/usr/bin/apt-get',
        'reboot_required_file': '/run/reboot-required',
        'stamp_file': '/var/lib/apt/periodic/unattended-upgrades-stamp',
        'update_stamp_file': '/var/lib/apt/periodic/update-stamp',
        'textfile_dir': '/var/lib/prometheus/node-exporter',
        'metrics_file': 'os_patch.prom',
    },
} %}
{%- set unattended_upgrades = salt['pillar.get']('unattended-upgrades:lookup', default=defaults, merge=True) %}
